## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run `npm run build` to ensure typescript compilation, Next.js build optimization, and CSS imports are valid.
- Run `npm run dev` and perform local visual inspection.

### Manual Verification
- Inspect the landing page at multiple breakpoints (Mobile, Tablet, Desktop) to verify layout responsiveness.
- Check the visual hierarchy of font sizes and colors, confirming the dominant blue, recessive red, and new typefaces look premium.
